# Task: Load a kernel module at boot with a module option

Configure this system to use the `{{module}}` kernel module with the module option `numdummies={{numdummies}}`.

Requirements:

- the `{{module}}` module must be loaded right now, with the option `numdummies={{numdummies}}` in effect;
- the module must be loaded automatically at every boot; persist the module load in the file `{{load_file}}`;
- the module option must also be applied at every boot; persist it in the file `{{options_file}}`.

The configuration must persist across reboots.
